OL,3,GNEWSAPolice admit unlawful home entry
OL,4,Aand assault of couple
OL,5,
OL,6,FA couple have been awarded #9,000 in
OL,7,Fdamages after police admitted its
OL,8,Fofficers unlawfully entered their home
OL,9,Fand assaulted them nearly four years
OL,10,Fago.
OL,12,FAndrew and Sabrina Fearn had a house
OL,13,Fparty in their home in December 2022.
OL,14,FEarlier, Sabrina had called police and
OL,15,Fofficers attended before leaving. They
OL,16,Fthen returned, believing someone was
OL,17,Finjured inside and wanted access.
