OL,3,GNEWSAPolice admit unlawful home entry
OL,4,Aand assault of couple
OL,5,
OL,6,FSabrina refused, but officers forced
OL,7,Fentry and used physical force on her,
OL,8,Faccording to legal documents. Andrew
OL,9,Fthen stepped in before "unnecessary
OL,10,Fforce" was used on him.
OL,12,FBoth were arrested and charged with
OL,13,Fassaulting an emergency worker, but
OL,14,Ftheir trial was halted when police
OL,15,Fadmitted the forced house entry was
OL,16,Funlawful.
